Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Sprint 3.4 Phase 2: fixed-onset A/W/WG/E arms, enforced
 cap, spend ledger, snapshots, tests

- Separate monitoring announcement (W/WG) from the 5-char cap (WG: instruction + code enforcement)
- Deterministic treatment onset (--arm, --treatment_round); raw vs delivered seller messages logged
- Round-4 state snapshots for later shared-prefix branching
- Per-call cost/usage/model logging, cumulative spend ceiling, OpenRouter-only provider guard
- Retries on non-JSON replies (sellers, buyers, overseer); deterministic message order; queue copies
- Offline tests with a fake model

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
